 "text": "Register of Deeds\nWelcome to the Ziebach County Website!\nHome\nOFFICES\nAssessor\nAuditor\nTreasurer\nRegister of Deeds\nClerk of Courts\nCommissioners\nZIEBACH COUNTY 4H\nNURSE\nEMERGENCY MANAGEMENT\nSHERIFF\nSTATES ATTORNEY\nVOTER INFORMATION\nMore\nHome\nOFFICES Assessor\nAuditor\nTreasurer\nRegister of Deeds\nClerk of Courts\nCommissioners\nZIEBACH COUNTY 4H\nNURSE\nEMERGENCY MANAGEMENT\nSHERIFF\nSTATES ATTORNEY\nVOTER INFORMATION\nHome\nOFFICES Assessor\nAuditor\nTreasurer\nRegister of Deeds\nClerk of Courts\nCommissioners\nZIEBACH COUNTY 4H\nNURSE\nEMERGENCY MANAGEMENT\nSHERIFF\nSTATES ATTORNEY\nVOTER INFORMATION\nZiebach County, SD\nZiebach County, SD Ziebach County, SD Ziebach County, SD\nWelcome to the Ziebach County, SD Website\nWelcome to the Ziebach County, SD Website Welcome to the Ziebach County, SD Website Welcome to the Ziebach County, SD Website\nRegister of Deeds\nregister of deeds\nThe county Register of Deeds issues and files marriage licenses, birth and death certificates, real estate transactions (including deeds, mortgages and mortgage transfers), federal and state tax liens, and military discharge records. The Register of Deeds is also responsible for recording all liens, cancel liens, duplicate titles, survey plat certificates and county welfare liens. The Register of Deeds is the official county record keeper.\nDocument Fees\nFees for licenses and certificates\nbirth certificate\n$15\nCertified\nDEATH CERTIFICATE\n$15\nCertified\nMarriage license\n$40\nmarriage certificate\n$15\nrecording documents\n$30\nfor more information, please call 605-365-5165\nCopyright © 2026 Ziebach County - All Rights Reserved.\nPowered by",
